{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本氣象廳信息，日本三重縣東南部海域於日本時間11月1日早上7時15分（香港時間早上6時15分）左右，發生6.1級地震。</p><p>震央位於北緯33.7度、東經137.1度，震源深度約350公里。</p><p>日本氣象廳稱，此次地震不會引發海嘯。</p><p>（日本氣象廳）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:06.059616+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T02:38:08.181173+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.059881+00:00","content_hash":"b55d2f9852f58118146bba37efc45a80eb2ead05bd796531d2f176a34f293069","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}